# Per engine-config rule: module records are run-package artifacts, NOT committed.
# These per-event inference dumps (rh_*/rw_* 2018-2025) are reproducible via INFERENCE
# on the committed gold bundle (no retrain):
#   py -m src.evo_predictor.run backtest-latent-power-module --emit-module-record \
#     --bundle params/gold/runtime_bundles/gold_cycle_260603_173742_2018thru2024/modules/driver_quali_power_from_{recent_history,race_weekend} \
#     --module driver_quali_power_from_{recent_history,race_weekend} --year <YYYY> \
#     [--compound-prior-root params/gold/compound_prior  # race_weekend only] \
#     --db-path data/f1_data_<YYYY>.db --output <records>/{rw,rh}_<YYYY>.json
# The numbers derived from them are committed in ../evidence/scope_anchor_numbers.json
# and ../evidence/g2_scope_run.txt.
*.npz
*.record.json
*.json
